{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You've been living in your treehouse in a corner of the woods for as long as you can remember. But today's the day you finally wake up and walk out the gates to the Wizard University.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is what you\u2019ve always wanted... right?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the magical city of Bizzaire!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the local wizards and weirdos! Everyone has something to say!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend the Great Wizard Tower under the magical tutelage of the Arcane Professor!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find items or equipment (or cupcakes) to help you on your journey!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes your character will have <i><strong>thoughts</strong></i>. Don\u2019t mind them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are there secrets? Are there hidden doors? I\u2019ll never tell.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896170/extras/5fa735f8635cf7de92f0e3282a9d7442.poster.avif?t=1773179210\" width=1008 height=672 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896170/extras/5fa735f8635cf7de92f0e3282a9d7442.webm?t=1773179210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896170/extras/5fa735f8635cf7de92f0e3282a9d7442.mp4?t=1773179210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do battle!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself in top down shoot-em-up style battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off waves of silly little guys who try and take you down!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield fire magic! Or electricity! Or grapes! (grapes?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip and use up to three spells at once!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every<i> </i>battle is story-dependent and hand-crafted.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896170/extras/a2f1ed73102e93156fc1f3beddcc4990.poster.avif?t=1773179210\" width=1008 height=672 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896170/extras/a2f1ed73102e93156fc1f3beddcc4990.webm?t=1773179210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896170/extras/a2f1ed73102e93156fc1f3beddcc4990.mp4?t=1773179210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What else?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-6 hours of story! (varies with play-style)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack by Arkington Owen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support! Accessibility options! Third useful thing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret minigames to find and play??? (you didn't hear that from me)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatrick is in this game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896170/extras/d1aee8f956474689b072421dd1a1b7b8.poster.avif?t=1773179210\" width=1170 height=257 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896170/extras/d1aee8f956474689b072421dd1a1b7b8.webm?t=1773179210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","back